  "prayer_fragments": [
    {
      "unit": "morning_entrance_verses",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "And I through the abundance of Thy grace enter Thy house and bow down before Thy holy place in awe of Thee.",
      "reference_scan": "s41",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "morning_entrance_verses",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "In the house of God let us walk in throngs.",
      "reference_scan": "s41",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "morning_mah_tovu",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "How becoming are your tents, O Jacob, your dwellings, O Israel.",
      "reference_scan": "s41",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "morning_mah_tovu",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "And I through the abundance of Thy grace enter Thy house and bow down before Thy holy place in awe of Thee.",
      "reference_scan": "s41",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "morning_mah_tovu",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "O Lord, I love the site of Thy house, the place of the dwelling of Thy glory.",
      "reference_scan": "s41",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "morning_mah_tovu",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "I bow, throw myself down and kneel before the Lord, my Maker.",
      "reference_scan": "s41",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "morning_mah_tovu",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "And as for me, my prayer is to Thee, O Lord, at a time of favour. O God, in the abundance of Thy grace respond to me with the truth of Thy salvation.",
      "reference_scan": "s41",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "shachar_avaqeshkha_gabirol",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "In the morning I seek Thee, my rock and my fortress. I order my morning and also my evening prayer before Thee.",
      "reference_scan": "s41",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "shachar_avaqeshkha_gabirol",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "Before Thy grandeur I stand and tremble, for Thine eye sees all the thoughts of my heart.",
      "reference_scan": "s41",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "shachar_avaqeshkha_gabirol",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "What can heart and tongue accomplish, what can my strength, what can the spirit within me.",
      "reference_scan": "s41",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "shachar_avaqeshkha_gabirol",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "Behold, man’s song pleases Thee. Therefore, I wish to thank Thee as long as God’s breath is in me.",
      "reference_scan": "s41",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "morning_before_prayer",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "I call to Thee, for Thou dost respond to me, O God, incline Thine ear to me, hear my word.",
      "reference_scan": "s41",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "morning_before_prayer",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "In righteousness may I behold Thy countenance, I am satisfied on waking with Thy likeness.",
      "reference_scan": "s41",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "morning_before_prayer",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "I trust in Thee, O Lord, I say, Thou art my God.",
      "reference_scan": "s41",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "morning_before_prayer",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "Hear the voice of my prayer when I implore Thee, when I raise my hands toward Thine inmost sanctuary.",
      "reference_scan": "s41",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "morning_before_prayer",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "O Lord my God, I implore Thee and Thou healest me.",
      "reference_scan": "s41",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "morning_before_prayer",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "Unto Thee, O Lord, do I call and my Master do I entreat.",
      "reference_scan": "s41",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "morning_before_prayer",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "Let Thy countenance shine upon Thy servant, help me in Thy grace.",
      "reference_scan": "s41",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "morning_before_prayer",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "For I wait for Thee, O Lord, Thou dost respond, O Lord my God.",
      "reference_scan": "s41",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    }
  ],
